# Magnus v1 hardening & ideas (agent reference)

## Before v1 hardening work (PR milestones on GitHub)

1. **Master plan:** `docs/review/V1_HARDENING_PLAN.md` — PR scope, gates, agent instructions.
2. **Progress log:** `docs/review/V1_HARDENING_LOG.md` — update every hardening PR.
3. **Pillar audit:** `docs/review/PILLAR_TOOL_AUDIT.md` — Gate B (tools → pillar).
4. **Context map:** `docs/review/PILLAR_CONTEXT_MAP.md` — Gate C (memory per intent).
5. **Smoke matrix:** `docs/review/CONNECTION_SMOKE_MATRIX.md` — PR #100 gate only.
6. **Architecture:** `docs/review/ARCHITECTURE_COHERENCE.md` — frozen spine target.

Planning docs live on **`main`** and do **not** count toward the 10 hardening PR milestones (#91–#100).

## Product ideas (post–v1 only)

- **Ideas backlog:** `docs/product/MAGNUS_IDEAS.md` — `IDEA-###` ids; not in scope during hardening unless owner assigns.
- **Do not** implement ideas from that doc during v1 hardening unless explicitly assigned.

## Operational tracker

- `magnus.md` at repo root — behaviour, env, database; update when shipping behaviour changes.

